<form version="1.1" theme="light">
  <label>Auto-cancel 재현용 (패널 30개, 대용량 검색)</label>
  <description>원본 이벤트 단계에서 eventstats/rex/dc/transaction/sort 0 등 무거운 연산을 수행합니다. 대상 인덱스와 기간을 키워 패널당 실행 시간을 200초 수준으로 맞추세요. 운영 시간대 부하에 주의하세요.</description>
  <fieldset submitButton="true" autoRun="false">
    <input type="text" token="idx">
      <label>대상 인덱스</label>
      <default>_internal</default>
    </input>
    <input type="time" token="tr">
      <label>기간</label>
      <default><earliest>-7d@d</earliest><latest>now</latest></default>
    </input>
  </fieldset>
  <row>
    <panel>
      <title>패널별 SID / 상태 / 실행시간(초) / 결과 건수</title>
      <html>
        <table class="table table-condensed table-striped"><thead><tr><th>패널</th><th>SID</th><th>상태</th><th>runDuration</th><th>resultCount</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>p01</td><td>$s_p01$</td><td>$s_p01_st$</td><td>$s_p01_rd$</td><td>$s_p01_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p02</td><td>$s_p02$</td><td>$s_p02_st$</td><td>$s_p02_rd$</td><td>$s_p02_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p03</td><td>$s_p03$</td><td>$s_p03_st$</td><td>$s_p03_rd$</td><td>$s_p03_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p04</td><td>$s_p04$</td><td>$s_p04_st$</td><td>$s_p04_rd$</td><td>$s_p04_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p05</td><td>$s_p05$</td><td>$s_p05_st$</td><td>$s_p05_rd$</td><td>$s_p05_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p06</td><td>$s_p06$</td><td>$s_p06_st$</td><td>$s_p06_rd$</td><td>$s_p06_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p07</td><td>$s_p07$</td><td>$s_p07_st$</td><td>$s_p07_rd$</td><td>$s_p07_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p08</td><td>$s_p08$</td><td>$s_p08_st$</td><td>$s_p08_rd$</td><td>$s_p08_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p09</td><td>$s_p09$</td><td>$s_p09_st$</td><td>$s_p09_rd$</td><td>$s_p09_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p10</td><td>$s_p10$</td><td>$s_p10_st$</td><td>$s_p10_rd$</td><td>$s_p10_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p11</td><td>$s_p11$</td><td>$s_p11_st$</td><td>$s_p11_rd$</td><td>$s_p11_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p12</td><td>$s_p12$</td><td>$s_p12_st$</td><td>$s_p12_rd$</td><td>$s_p12_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p13</td><td>$s_p13$</td><td>$s_p13_st$</td><td>$s_p13_rd$</td><td>$s_p13_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p14</td><td>$s_p14$</td><td>$s_p14_st$</td><td>$s_p14_rd$</td><td>$s_p14_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p15</td><td>$s_p15$</td><td>$s_p15_st$</td><td>$s_p15_rd$</td><td>$s_p15_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p16</td><td>$s_p16$</td><td>$s_p16_st$</td><td>$s_p16_rd$</td><td>$s_p16_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p17</td><td>$s_p17$</td><td>$s_p17_st$</td><td>$s_p17_rd$</td><td>$s_p17_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p18</td><td>$s_p18$</td><td>$s_p18_st$</td><td>$s_p18_rd$</td><td>$s_p18_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p19</td><td>$s_p19$</td><td>$s_p19_st$</td><td>$s_p19_rd$</td><td>$s_p19_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p20</td><td>$s_p20$</td><td>$s_p20_st$</td><td>$s_p20_rd$</td><td>$s_p20_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p21</td><td>$s_p21$</td><td>$s_p21_st$</td><td>$s_p21_rd$</td><td>$s_p21_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p22</td><td>$s_p22$</td><td>$s_p22_st$</td><td>$s_p22_rd$</td><td>$s_p22_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p23</td><td>$s_p23$</td><td>$s_p23_st$</td><td>$s_p23_rd$</td><td>$s_p23_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p24</td><td>$s_p24$</td><td>$s_p24_st$</td><td>$s_p24_rd$</td><td>$s_p24_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p25</td><td>$s_p25$</td><td>$s_p25_st$</td><td>$s_p25_rd$</td><td>$s_p25_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p26</td><td>$s_p26$</td><td>$s_p26_st$</td><td>$s_p26_rd$</td><td>$s_p26_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p27</td><td>$s_p27$</td><td>$s_p27_st$</td><td>$s_p27_rd$</td><td>$s_p27_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p28</td><td>$s_p28$</td><td>$s_p28_st$</td><td>$s_p28_rd$</td><td>$s_p28_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p29</td><td>$s_p29$</td><td>$s_p29_st$</td><td>$s_p29_rd$</td><td>$s_p29_rc$</td></tr><tr><td>p30</td><td>$s_p30$</td><td>$s_p30_st$</td><td>$s_p30_rd$</td><td>$s_p30_rc$</td></tr></tbody></table>
      </html>
    </panel>
  </row>
  <row>
      <panel id="p01">
        <title>01. 원본 eventstats: host별 건수 → 비율</title>
        <table>
          <search>
            <query>index=$idx$ | eventstats count as host_cnt by host | eventstats count as total | eval ratio=round(host_cnt*100/total,3) | stats max(ratio) as ratio max(host_cnt) as cnt by host | sort - cnt</query>
            <earliest>$tr.earliest$</earliest>
            <latest>$tr.latest$</latest>
            <progress><set token="s_p01">$job.sid$</set><set token="s_p01_st">RUNNING</set></progress>
            <done><set token="s_p01_st">$job.dispatchState$</set><set token="s_p01_rd">$job.runDuration$</set><set token="s_p01_rc">$job.resultCount$</set></done>
            <error><set token="s_p01_st">ERROR: $message$</set></error>
            <fail><set token="s_p01_st">FAIL: $message$</set></fail>
            <cancelled><set token="s_p01_st">CANCELLED</set></cancelled>
          </search>
          <option name="count">10</option>
          <option name="drilldown">none</option>
        </table>
      </panel>
      <panel id="p02">
        <title>02. 원본 eventstats: sourcetype별 평균 길이 초과 이벤트</title>
        <table>
          <search>
            <query>index=$idx$ | eval len=len(_raw) | eventstats avg(len) as avg_len by sourcetype | where len&gt;avg_len | stats count avg(len) as avg_len by sourcetype | sort - count</query>
            <earliest>$tr.earliest$</earliest>
            <latest>$tr.latest$</latest>
            <progress><set token="s_p02">$job.sid$</set><set token="s_p02_st">RUNNING</set></progress>
            <done><set token="s_p02_st">$job.dispatchState$</set><set token="s_p02_rd">$job.runDuration$</set><set token="s_p02_rc">$job.resultCount$</set></done>
            <error><set token="s_p02_st">ERROR: $message$</set></error>
            <fail><set token="s_p02_st">FAIL: $message$</set></fail>
            <cancelled><set token="s_p02_st">CANCELLED</set></cancelled>
          </search>
          <option name="count">10</option>
          <option name="drilldown">none</option>
        </table>
      </panel>
      <panel id="p03">
        <title>03. 원본 eventstats: source별 평균 대비 길이</title>
        <table>
          <search>
            <query>index=$idx$ | eval len=len(_raw) | eventstats avg(len) as a stdev(len) as s by source | eval z=if(s&gt;0,(len-a)/s,0) | where z&gt;2 | stats count by source | sort - count | head 30</query>
            <earliest>$tr.earliest$</earliest>
            <latest>$tr.latest$</latest>
            <progress><set token="s_p03">$job.sid$</set><set token="s_p03_st">RUNNING</set></progress>
            <done><set token="s_p03_st">$job.dispatchState$</set><set token="s_p03_rd">$job.runDuration$</set><set token="s_p03_rc">$job.resultCount$</set></done>
            <error><set token="s_p03_st">ERROR: $message$</set></error>
            <fail><set token="s_p03_st">FAIL: $message$</set></fail>
            <cancelled><set token="s_p03_st">CANCELLED</set></cancelled>
          </search>
          <option name="count">10</option>
          <option name="drilldown">none</option>
        </table>
      </panel>
  </row>
  <row>
      <panel id="p04">
        <title>04. 원본 eventstats 다중 by: host×sourcetype</title>
        <table>
          <search>
            <query>index=$idx$ | eventstats count as c by host sourcetype | eventstats dc(sourcetype) as st_per_host by host | stats max(c) as c max(st_per_host) as st by host sourcetype | sort - c | head 50</query>
            <earliest>$tr.earliest$</earliest>
            <latest>$tr.latest$</latest>
            <progress><set token="s_p04">$job.sid$</set><set token="s_p04_st">RUNNING</set></progress>
            <done><set token="s_p04_st">$job.dispatchState$</set><set token="s_p04_rd">$job.runDuration$</set><set token="s_p04_rc">$job.resultCount$</set></done>
            <error><set token="s_p04_st">ERROR: $message$</set></error>
            <fail><set token="s_p04_st">FAIL: $message$</set></fail>
            <cancelled><set token="s_p04_st">CANCELLED</set></cancelled>
          </search>
          <option name="count">10</option>
          <option name="drilldown">none</option>
        </table>
      </panel>
      <panel id="p05">
        <title>05. _raw 고유값 개수 (dc)</title>
        <table>
          <search>
            <query>index=$idx$ | stats dc(_raw) as uniq count by sourcetype | eval dup_ratio=round((count-uniq)*100/count,2) | sort - count</query>
            <earliest>$tr.earliest$</earliest>
            <latest>$tr.latest$</latest>
            <progress><set token="s_p05">$job.sid$</set><set token="s_p05_st">RUNNING</set></progress>
            <done><set token="s_p05_st">$job.dispatchState$</set><set token="s_p05_rd">$job.runDuration$</set><set token="s_p05_rc">$job.resultCount$</set></done>
            <error><set token="s_p05_st">ERROR: $message$</set></error>
            <fail><set token="s_p05_st">FAIL: $message$</set></fail>
            <cancelled><set token="s_p05_st">CANCELLED</set></cancelled>
          </search>
          <option name="count">10</option>
          <option name="drilldown">none</option>
        </table>
      </panel>
      <panel id="p06">
        <title>06. md5 해시 고유값</title>
        <table>
          <search>
            <query>index=$idx$ | eval h=md5(_raw) | stats dc(h) as uniq count by host | sort - count</query>
            <earliest>$tr.earliest$</earliest>
            <latest>$tr.latest$</latest>
            <progress><set token="s_p06">$job.sid$</set><set token="s_p06_st">RUNNING</set></progress>
            <done><set token="s_p06_st">$job.dispatchState$</set><set token="s_p06_rd">$job.runDuration$</set><set token="s_p06_rc">$job.resultCount$</set></done>
            <error><set token="s_p06_st">ERROR: $message$</set></error>
            <fail><set token="s_p06_st">FAIL: $message$</set></fail>
            <cancelled><set token="s_p06_st">CANCELLED</set></cancelled>
          </search>
          <option name="count">10</option>
          <option name="drilldown">none</option>
        </table>
      </panel>
  </row>
  <row>
      <panel id="p07">
        <title>07. punct 패턴 상위</title>
        <table>
          <search>
            <query>index=$idx$ | stats count dc(host) as hosts by punct | sort - count | head 30</query>
            <earliest>$tr.earliest$</earliest>
            <latest>$tr.latest$</latest>
            <progress><set token="s_p07">$job.sid$</set><set token="s_p07_st">RUNNING</set></progress>
            <done><set token="s_p07_st">$job.dispatchState$</set><set token="s_p07_rd">$job.runDuration$</set><set token="s_p07_rc">$job.resultCount$</set></done>
            <error><set token="s_p07_st">ERROR: $message$</set></error>
            <fail><set token="s_p07_st">FAIL: $message$</set></fail>
            <cancelled><set token="s_p07_st">CANCELLED</set></cancelled>
          </search>
          <option name="count">10</option>
          <option name="drilldown">none</option>
        </table>
      </panel>
      <panel id="p08">
        <title>08. rex 단어 추출 → 고유 단어 수</title>
        <table>
          <search>
            <query>index=$idx$ | rex max_match=20 field=_raw "(?&lt;word&gt;[A-Za-z_]{4,})" | mvexpand word | stats dc(word) as words count by sourcetype | sort - words</query>
            <earliest>$tr.earliest$</earliest>
            <latest>$tr.latest$</latest>
            <progress><set token="s_p08">$job.sid$</set><set token="s_p08_st">RUNNING</set></progress>
            <done><set token="s_p08_st">$job.dispatchState$</set><set token="s_p08_rd">$job.runDuration$</set><set token="s_p08_rc">$job.resultCount$</set></done>
            <error><set token="s_p08_st">ERROR: $message$</set></error>
            <fail><set token="s_p08_st">FAIL: $message$</set></fail>
            <cancelled><set token="s_p08_st">CANCELLED</set></cancelled>
          </search>
          <option name="count">10</option>
          <option name="drilldown">none</option>
        </table>
      </panel>
      <panel id="p09">
        <title>09. rex key=value 추출 상위 키</title>
        <chart>
          <search>
            <query>index=$idx$ | rex max_match=30 field=_raw "(?&lt;k&gt;[A-Za-z_]+)=" | mvexpand k | stats count by k | sort - count | head 30</query>
            <earliest>$tr.earliest$</earliest>
            <latest>$tr.latest$</latest>
            <progress><set token="s_p09">$job.sid$</set><set token="s_p09_st">RUNNING</set></progress>
            <done><set token="s_p09_st">$job.dispatchState$</set><set token="s_p09_rd">$job.runDuration$</set><set token="s_p09_rc">$job.resultCount$</set></done>
            <error><set token="s_p09_st">ERROR: $message$</set></error>
            <fail><set token="s_p09_st">FAIL: $message$</set></fail>
            <cancelled><set token="s_p09_st">CANCELLED</set></cancelled>
          </search>
          <option name="charting.chart">bar</option>
          <option name="charting.legend.placement">bottom</option>
        </chart>
      </panel>
  </row>
  <row>
      <panel id="p10">
        <title>10. 이벤트 길이 분포</title>
        <chart>
          <search>
            <query>index=$idx$ | eval len=len(_raw) | bin len span=200 | stats count by len | sort len</query>
            <earliest>$tr.earliest$</earliest>
            <latest>$tr.latest$</latest>
            <progress><set token="s_p10">$job.sid$</set><set token="s_p10_st">RUNNING</set></progress>
            <done><set token="s_p10_st">$job.dispatchState$</set><set token="s_p10_rd">$job.runDuration$</set><set token="s_p10_rc">$job.resultCount$</set></done>
            <error><set token="s_p10_st">ERROR: $message$</set></error>
            <fail><set token="s_p10_st">FAIL: $message$</set></fail>
            <cancelled><set token="s_p10_st">CANCELLED</set></cancelled>
          </search>
          <option name="charting.chart">column</option>
          <option name="charting.legend.placement">bottom</option>
        </chart>
      </panel>
      <panel id="p11">
        <title>11. 시간대×sourcetype 히트맵용</title>
        <table>
          <search>
            <query>index=$idx$ | eval hour=strftime(_time,"%H") | eventstats count as st_total by sourcetype | stats count by hour sourcetype | sort hour</query>
            <earliest>$tr.earliest$</earliest>
            <latest>$tr.latest$</latest>
            <progress><set token="s_p11">$job.sid$</set><set token="s_p11_st">RUNNING</set></progress>
            <done><set token="s_p11_st">$job.dispatchState$</set><set token="s_p11_rd">$job.runDuration$</set><set token="s_p11_rc">$job.resultCount$</set></done>
            <error><set token="s_p11_st">ERROR: $message$</set></error>
            <fail><set token="s_p11_st">FAIL: $message$</set></fail>
            <cancelled><set token="s_p11_st">CANCELLED</set></cancelled>
          </search>
          <option name="count">10</option>
          <option name="drilldown">none</option>
        </table>
      </panel>
      <panel id="p12">
        <title>12. 1분 단위 timechart by host</title>
        <chart>
          <search>
            <query>index=$idx$ | timechart span=1m count by host limit=20</query>
            <earliest>$tr.earliest$</earliest>
            <latest>$tr.latest$</latest>
            <progress><set token="s_p12">$job.sid$</set><set token="s_p12_st">RUNNING</set></progress>
            <done><set token="s_p12_st">$job.dispatchState$</set><set token="s_p12_rd">$job.runDuration$</set><set token="s_p12_rc">$job.resultCount$</set></done>
            <error><set token="s_p12_st">ERROR: $message$</set></error>
